# This directory holds raw CTU-13 binetflow CSV files for ML training.
#
# Download from: https://www.stratosphereips.org/datasets-ctu13
#
# Recommended scenarios (binetflow format):
#   scenario1.binetflow   — Neris botnet (spam + click fraud)
#   scenario2.binetflow   — Neris botnet (variant)
#   scenario9.binetflow   — Murlo botnet
#   scenario10.binetflow  — NSIS.ay botnet
#   scenario11.binetflow  — Rbot botnet
#
# CSV columns: StartTime, Dur, Proto, SrcAddr, Sport, Dir,
#              DstAddr, Dport, State, sTos, dTos, TotPkts,
#              TotBytes, SrcBytes, Label
#
# After placing binetflow files here, run:
#   python scripts/ingest_cicids.py --dataset ctu13 --path data/raw/ctu13/
#
# This will convert the botnet flows to Zelvryn's 20-dimensional
# feature vector format and append to data/processed/corpus_features.json
#
# This .gitkeep file is intentionally tracked by git to preserve the
# directory structure. The binetflow files themselves are in .gitignore.
